WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
- New in theaters this weekend, Joker.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.490
What will you see?

00:00:03.490 --> 00:00:05.389
This is your weekend ticket.

00:00:05.389 --> 00:00:08.722
(calm percussive music)

00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:14.593
- [Joker] My mother always tells me.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:18.563
To smile, and put on a happy face.

00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.683
She told me I had a purpose.

00:00:26.030 --> 00:00:28.233
To bring laughter and joy to the world.

00:00:30.045 --> 00:00:30.878
Hey!

00:00:30.878 --> 00:00:32.459
Stop them!

00:00:32.459 --> 00:00:35.126
(ominous music)

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:38.363
Is it just me,

00:00:41.380 --> 00:00:43.443
or is it getting crazier out there?

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:47.320
- At last, Joker hits
theaters this weekend.

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.160
In this standalone origin story,

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:51.180
Joaquin Phoenix plays Arthur Fleck,

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:53.240
a man who is beaten down, mocked,

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.570
and is never taken seriously.

00:00:55.570 --> 00:00:58.880
As society continues to wear
on him, he starts to crack

00:00:58.880 --> 00:01:02.570
and see the whole world
as being one big joke.

00:01:02.570 --> 00:01:05.130
And it isn't long before
he completely breaks,

00:01:05.130 --> 00:01:07.680
and he himself becomes a joker.

00:01:07.680 --> 00:01:10.430
(Joker laughing)

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:13.870
The film is to be a version of the Joker

00:01:13.870 --> 00:01:17.590
we haven't seen on the big
screen, and will launch DC Black,

00:01:17.590 --> 00:01:20.460
a whole different universe
of comic book inspired films,

00:01:20.460 --> 00:01:23.130
with a much darker and serious tone.

00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:24.120
This movie's for you

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:27.160
if you're down for a grim
and gritty origin story,

00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:28.930
you wanna see the film that got an

00:01:28.930 --> 00:01:31.840
eight minute standing ovation
at the Venice Film Festival,

00:01:31.840 --> 00:01:33.760
or you're gonna be that guy

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:35.960
and dress as Joker for Halloween.

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:38.830
I'm going as Harley Quinn, so.

00:01:38.830 --> 00:01:40.480
That is your weekend ticket.

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:41.400
What will you see?

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:43.820
And check back next week to
see who's a better actor,

00:01:43.820 --> 00:01:46.643
Will Smith, or Will Smith.

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:48.883
Who's the second guy?

